      "attrs": {
        "src": "/assets/content/acp-lab-notes/database-audit-reports/05.webp",
        "alt": "Screen 5. Download becomes available after report generation.",
        "title": null,
        "width": "100%",
        "height": null,
        "caption": "Screen 5. Download becomes available after report generation."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Receiving Summary and Detail Together"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The ZIP contained one HTML report and two CSVs. In the browser, HTML showed three active privileges, zero inactive, and 22 access-history records."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "attrs": {
        "src": "/assets/content/acp-lab-notes/database-audit-reports/06.webp",
        "alt": "Screen 6. Downloaded original report with privilege and history totals.",
        "title": null,
        "width": "100%",
        "height": null,
        "caption": "Screen 6. Downloaded original report with privilege and history totals."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The privileges CSV listed DB Route Lab, Orders Control Lab, and Orders Demo MySQL, all Read-Only/SELECT/Active, with grant, expiry, and last-access times."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The 22 history entries comprised 13 connects and nine disconnects. DB Route Lab’s 13:14:06 connect and 13:16:03 disconnect retained user, connection, and Success."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I could start with the summary and inspect CSV details as needed, avoiding separate extraction and assembly."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Report Downloads Are Audited Too"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The task’s Action History included Report Download by Demo Auditor, download time, and report number 1."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "attrs": {
        "src": "/assets/content/acp-lab-notes/database-audit-reports/07.webp",
        "alt": "Screen 7. Who downloaded which report and when.",
        "title": null,
        "width": "100%",
        "height": null,
        "caption": "Screen 7. Who downloaded which report and when."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "One user’s test clarified the materials available for real reviews. Current privileges and recent activity arrive together, with a path from summary to detail—a practical tool for preparing access-review evidence."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This lab used QueryPie Community 11.6.7. Reports was labeled Beta, downloaded reports were in English, and users/databases were fictional."
        }
      ]
    },
